---
<section class="py-20 border-t border-gray-200/50 relative z-10 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full">
  <div class="text-center mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tertiary mb-3">Onboarding</h2>
    <h3 class="text-heading-32 sm:text-heading-40 font-bold text-gray-1000 tracking-tight">
      Confidential by design. How it works.
    </h3>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 sm:gap-12">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-sm border border-gray-200 bg-background-200">
      <div class="text-heading-36 font-extrabold text-gray-300/30 mb-4">01</div>
      <h4 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Verify Your Email</h4>
      <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Register using your university email. The system verifies you are a student, then hashes and discards the email immediately. It is never stored.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-sm border border-gray-200 bg-background-200">
      <div class="text-heading-36 font-extrabold text-gray-300/30 mb-4">02</div>
      <h4 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Get An Anonymous Persona</h4>
      <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        The platform generates a persistent random avatar seed and displayName (e.g., "Silver Fox"). This is your only identity in forums and chat.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-sm border border-gray-200 bg-background-200">
      <div class="text-heading-36 font-extrabold text-gray-300/30 mb-4">03</div>
      <h4 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Receive Safe Support</h4>
      <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Engage in group chats, text 1-on-1 with verified peer mentors, sign up for workshops, or access professional local crisis lines when needed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
